<%- include('partials/head') %>
<div class="hero">
  <div class="mark-lg">G</div>
  <h1>GTAMP</h1>
  <p class="sub">FiveM-style GTA V multiplayer. Browse servers, run your own, script your own world.</p>
  <a href="/download/GTAMP-Launcher-v1.6.0.exe" class="btn btn-accent btn-lg">DOWNLOAD</a>
  <div class="badge">
    <span class="live-dot"></span> <%= liveCount %> live server<%= liveCount===1?'':'s' %> · <%= livePlayers %> player<%= livePlayers===1?'':'s' %> active in the launcher
  </div>
</div>

<section style="padding-top:0">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="grid g3">
      <div class="card"><h3>🖥 Browse Servers</h3><p>Live player counts synced straight from the launcher. Filter by tags and mode.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>🚀 Run Your Own</h3><p>Create a server and install artifacts in minutes. Invite LAN friends or the world.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>📦 Marketplace</h3><p>Buy and sell scripts and assets. Publish your own via the Keymaster.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="requirements" style="background:var(--panel);border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 class="section-title">System Requirements</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">Make sure your PC can run Grand Theft Auto V with the GTAMP launcher.</p>
    <div class="grid g2">
      <div class="req">
        <div class="h">Minimum</div>
        <ul>
          <li><span>OS</span><b>Windows 10 64-bit</b></li>
          <li><span>Processor</span><b>Intel Core i5-3470 / AMD FX-6300</b></li>
          <li><span>Memory</span><b>8 GB RAM</b></li>
          <li><span>Graphics</span><b>NVIDIA GTX 660 / Radeon HD 7870</b></li>
          <li><span>Storage</span><b>110 GB available (GTA V)</b></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="req">
        <div class="h">Recommended</div>
        <ul>
          <li><span>OS</span><b>Windows 10/11 64-bit</b></li>
          <li><span>Processor</span><b>Intel Core i7-4790 / Ryzen 5 1600</b></li>
          <li><span>Memory</span><b>16 GB RAM</b></li>
          <li><span>Graphics</span><b>NVIDIA GTX 1060 / RX 580</b></li>
          <li><span>Storage</span><b>SSD recommended</b></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="wrap center">
    <h2 class="section-title">Run Your Own Server</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">Host GTAMP for your friends or the whole community.</p>
    <a href="/run-server" class="btn btn-accent btn-lg">CREATE YOUR OWN SERVER</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="faq" style="background:var(--panel);border-top:1px solid var(--line)">
  <div class="wrap" style="max-width:820px">
    <h2 class="section-title">FAQ</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">Common questions.</p>
    <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q">What is GTAMP?</div><div class="faq-a">A FiveM-style multiplayer launcher for GTA V, built entirely with our own code.</div></div>
    <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q">Is it FiveM?</div><div class="faq-a">No. GTAMP is inspired by FiveM's architecture but is its own codebase.</div></div>
    <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q">Do I need the Rockstar Launcher?</div><div class="faq-a">Yes — GTA must be started through the platform it was bought from (Steam, Rockstar, or Epic).</div></div>
    <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q">How do I run my own server?</div><div class="faq-a">Click "Create your own server", install the artifacts, and follow the docs.</div></div>
  </div>
</section>

<%- include('partials/foot') %>
